<title>BRAZIL: Brahma Jan-Sept net up at 207.3 mln reais.</title>
<headline>Brahma Jan-Sept net up at 207.3 mln reais.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brazilian brewery Companhia Cervejaria Brahma announced the following results for the January-September period.</p>
<p>			  Jan-September 1996     Jan-September 1995</p>
<p> Net income		  207.3 million		  160.7 million</p>
<p> Net sales		   1.8 bln		    1.7 bln</p>
<p> Share profit		27.54 reais		22.98 reais</p>
<p>Note: Figures in Brazilian reais.</p>
<p>Share profit figures provided in lots of 1,000 shares.</p>
<p>-- Simona de Logu, Rio de Janeiro Newsroom 5521 507 4151</p>
</text>
